From 31a017347d98440c2f16841abdb0fc24ba39f866 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BannedPenta01 <BannedPenta01@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 00:40:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] launcher: community patch catalog, first-run offer, patches
 button

Fetch the patch index from the community repository, offer performance
patches when running a game that has them (one-time disclaimer with
opt-out, download, success notice), replace the toolbar delete button
with a band-aid patches button opening per-game selection, and add
community download plus repository link to the patches dialog.
